{
  "file_id": "3550",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 193,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Where are we? Did we get blown\naway by the wind?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16840,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "¿Dónde estamos? ¿Nos arrastró\nel viento?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Huh? There's a restaurant there.",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16889,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¿Eh? Hay un restaurante ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Let's go check it out! Maybe we'll\ndiscover something!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16922,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡Vamos a verlo! ¡Seguro que\nencontramos algo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "All right, I'll have the usual\nshaved ice.",
      "speaker_id": 4081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16977,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Vale, el granizado\nde siempre."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Me too!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17020,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Yo también!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "All right, got it! Thank you for\nyour continued patronage!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17028,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "¡Vale, marchando! ¡Gracias\npor venir siempre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Hey, you! Go find more customers!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17087,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Eh, tú! ¡Busca más clientes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "*sigh*",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17121,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Uf..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Hm?! Gomamon!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17128,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¿Eh?! ¡Gomamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Gomamon!",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17142,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Gomamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Gabumon...? And Matt!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17151,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Gabumon...? ¡Y Matt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "So does that mean Joe's here?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17175,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¿Entonces Joe está aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Yeah! He's over here! Come with\nme!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17205,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Está aquí! ¡Ven\nconmigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Joe! So you were here!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17241,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Joe! ¡Estabas aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Ah, well...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17264,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "Ah, pues..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "After everyone left, it was just\nme and T.K...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17276,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Al irse todos, solo\nquedamos T.K. y yo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Well, after we all split up, while\nwe were looking for food...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17326,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Bueno, tras separarnos,\nmientras buscábamos comida..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "a Digimon who said he'd seen\nhumans led us astray.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17389,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "un Digimon nos despistó\ndiciendo que vio humanos."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "So that's what happened...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17440,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "Así que fue eso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "We wanted to come back, but we got\nlost. And when we started getting\nhungry, we found this place...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17467,
      "_bytes": 99,
      "translation": "Queríamos volver, pero nos\nperdimos. Cuando nos entró\nhambre, hallamos este sitio..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "So then, why are you working here?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17567,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Entonces, ¿por qué trabajas aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "\"We only take dollars, not\nJapanese yen! You have to work off\nwhat you ate!\" he said.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17602,
      "_bytes": 85,
      "translation": "\"¡Solo aceptamos dólares, no\nyenes! ¡Debes trabajar\nlo que comiste!\", dijo."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "So you're saying you *have* to\nwork here.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17688,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¿En serio tienes que\ntrabajar aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "You're too slow! The customers are\nwaiting! Hurry up and get the food\nout!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17730,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "¡Eres muy lento! ¡Los clientes\nesperan! ¡Rápido, saca\nla comida ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Y-yes, sir!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17805,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡S-sí, señor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Hm? Who're you?",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17817,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "I'm his friend.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17833,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Soy su amigo."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Hmph! Whaddya want?",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17849,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Hmph! ¿Qué quieres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "How much longer does he have to\nwork?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17869,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¿Cuánto más tiene que\ntrabajar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Well, it was originally supposed\nto be only three days...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17907,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "Bueno, al principio iban a ser\nsolo tres días..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "...but every time I mess up he\nadds more, so it's around two\nweeks now!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17965,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "...pero cada vez que fallo\nme pone más días, ¡y ya van\ncasi dos semanas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "He's terrible! I suffer losses due\nto him, so I'm just having him\nmake it up!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18037,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "¡Es un desastre! ¡Pierdo dinero\npor su culpa, así que le hago\ncompensarlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "What's going on, what's with all\nthe fighting?",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18115,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, a qué viene\ntanta pelea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Mr. Digitamamon!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18162,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Sr. Digitamamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "So you're the owner. This is my\nfriend. Hasn't he worked enough?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18179,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Así que eres el dueño. Este es mi\namigo. ¿No ha trabajado bastante?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Don't make me laugh! Although if\nyou worked the debt off with him,\nit'd be a different story...",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18244,
      "_bytes": 95,
      "translation": "¡No me hagas reír! Aunque si\ntú también pagaras la deuda,\nsería otra historia..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "About that...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18340,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "Sobre eso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "If you can't, you're getting in\nthe way of business.",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18354,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Si no puedes, estorbas\nal negocio."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Am I gonna be stuck here for the\nrest of my life?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18407,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¿Me voy a quedar aquí\npara siempre?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "T.K's waiting for me, so I'll\nbe back. Wait for me.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18457,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "T.K. me espera, así que\nvolveré. Espérame."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Huh? Then...!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18512,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¡Entonces...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Then, I'll help you work. Sound\ngood?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18526,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Entonces te ayudo. ¿Te\nparece bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Matt! I'm in your debt!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18564,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Matt! ¡Te debo una!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Oh? You're PicoDevimon...",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18590,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Ah? Eres DemiDevimon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "I have a favor to ask of you. Of\ncourse, I'll pay you handsomely.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18616,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Necesito pedirte un favor.\nClaro, te pagaré muy bien."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "So? What do you want me to do?",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18682,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Y bien? ¿Qué quieres que haga?"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Nothing much, just something\neasy...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18713,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Nada del otro mundo,\nalgo fácil..."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Wait! Where do you think you're\ngoing?",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18750,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Espera! ¿A dónde te crees\nque vas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Where...?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18789,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¿A dónde?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "You're going to come back and work\nwith him!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18799,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡Vas a volver y trabajar\ncon él!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Huh? What's with the turning heel\nall of a sudden?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18844,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿A qué viene darte\nla vuelta así, de repente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "So, you don't care about what'll\nhappen to your friend in the\nmeantime?",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18895,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Entonces, ¿no te importa lo\nque le pase a tu amigo\nmientras tanto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18967,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "What should we do, Matt?",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18974,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Qué hacemos, Matt?"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 19001,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Go see T.K, Matt. I'll be\nfine.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19005,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Ve con T.K., Matt. Estaré\nbien."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "No, it's fine.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19042,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "No, estoy bien."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Aren't you worried about T.K?\nHurry up and go.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19057,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¿No te preocupa T.K.?\nVe ya, rápido."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I said it's fine, didn't I?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19107,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Ya dije que estoy bien, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Did I say something to upset you?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19135,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Dije algo que te molestara?"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "(Joe's saying this because he's\nworried about me, and yet I...)",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19169,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "(Joe dice esto porque está\npreocupado por mí, pero yo...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I'm sorry for yelling at you.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19233,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Siento haberte gritado."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19263,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Let's work hard, Joe.",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19273,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "A trabajar, Joe."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "We're with you, too!",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19295,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Nosotros también estamos\ncontigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Yeah. You're right...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19316,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Sí. Tienes razón..."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Hey! You've gotten the order\nwrong!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19338,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Eh! ¡Te has equivocado\nde pedido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "W-what? That's weird...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19374,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Q-qué? Qué raro..."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Ten more days!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19398,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Diez días más!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I'm sorry. I won't mess up from\nnow on, I swear!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19413,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Lo siento. ¡No fallaré\nmás, lo juro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 19462,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "(How long do I have to keep doing\nthis?! I promised T.K...)",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19466,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "(¿Hasta cuándo tendré que\nseguir así? Prometí a T.K...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "We're in a good position here.\nNow, just one more thing...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19529,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Estamos en buena posición.\nAhora, una cosa más..."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Hey, are you still peeling\npotatoes?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19588,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Oye, ¿sigues pelando\npatatas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Ah, let me get them. I'm washing\nthis...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19625,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Ah, ya las traigo. Estoy\nlavando esto..."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Hurry up!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19666,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Rápido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I-I know!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19676,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡L-lo sé!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "There, it's the perfect trick!\nHe'll fall right down!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19686,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Listo, el truco perfecto!\n¡Se caerá seguro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Here we go... huh?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19740,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Allá va... ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Huh?! W-why? Well, whatever.\nYou'll see! I'm not done with you\nyet!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19759,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡¿Eh?! ¿P-por qué? Bueno, da igual.\n¡Ya verás! ¡Aún no he\nacabado contigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19827,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Sora..."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "It's fine...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19835,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Está bien..."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "What a beautiful sound.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19848,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Qué sonido tan bonito."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19872,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "I'm just a passing-by bat Digimon.\nYou seem like a pretty honest and\nloyal person.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19885,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "Solo soy un Digimon murciélago\nde paso. Pareces una persona\nmuy honesta y leal."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Sacrificing yourself for your\nfriends and all.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19968,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Sacrificarte por tus\namigos y todo eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "You know about that?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20015,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¿Sabes de eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Yes. But on the other hand, your\nfriend...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20036,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Sí. Pero por otro lado,\ntu amigo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Joe? What about Joe?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20079,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¿Joe? ¿Qué le pasa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "I hear he's messing up on purpose.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20100,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Dicen que la lía a propósito."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "What?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20135,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¿Qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "He's just afraid of being left\nalone.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20141,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Solo teme quedarse\nsolo."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "I doubt Joe would do that.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20179,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "Dudo que Joe hiciera eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Hm... you're a pretty nice guy...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20206,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Vaya... eres bastante majo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Joe... is doing it on purpose?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20240,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Joe... ¿lo hace aposta?"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Please! Let me go pick up my\nbrother! I'll come back, I\npromise!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20271,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Por favor! ¡Déjame ir a\nbuscar a mi hermano!\n¡Volveré, lo prometo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Nope, nope.",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20336,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "No, no."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Why? I *swear* I'll come back and\nwork!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20348,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¿Por qué? ¡JURO que\nvolveré a trabajar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 20388,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Heeheehee...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20392,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Jijiji..."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Aaah! The dishes broke on their\nown!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20405,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Aaah! ¡Los platos se han\nroto solos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "What are you doing?\nBoth of you, you'll be working one\nmore week!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20442,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "¿Qué estáis haciendo?\n¡Los dos trabajaréis una\nsemana más!"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Cut it out, Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20508,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Ya vale, Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Y-you've got it wrong! I didn't\neven touch the dishes! They fell\non their own!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20525,
      "_bytes": 78,
      "translation": "¡T-te equivocas! ¡Ni\nsiquiera toqué los platos!\n¡Se cayeron solos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Stop making excuses!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20604,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Deja de excusarte!"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "I'm telling the truth, Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20625,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Te digo la verdad, Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Mattooooo!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20658,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Maaaaatt!"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "That voice? It can't be!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20671,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¿Esa voz? ¡No puede ser!"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20696,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Matt! It's so good to see you\nagain!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20704,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Matt! ¡Qué alegría\nverte de nuevo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "How did you...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20743,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¿Cómo has...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "I came here with Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20758,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Vine aquí con Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Tai...!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20783,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Tai...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Hey!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20794,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Eh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "So you're alive...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20799,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Sigues vivo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Think I'm gonna let myself kick\nthe bucket before you do?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20818,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "¿Crees que me voy a morir\nantes que tú?"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Tai... thanks for taking care\nof T.K.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20876,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Tai... gracias por cuidar\nde T.K."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Don't worry about it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20920,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡No te preocupes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "T.K, I'm sorry. I couldn't come\nback for you like I promised.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20942,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "T.K., lo siento. No pude\nvolver a por ti como prometí."
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "It's okay, don't worry! We got to\nsee each other again in the end,\nanyway!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21007,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "¡No pasa nada, tranquilo!\n¡Al final nos hemos vuelto\na ver, de todos modos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "Anyway, it doesn't look like\nthere's anyone here, so let's make\na run for it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21082,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "¡Bueno, parece que no hay\nnadie aquí, así que\naprovechemos para escapar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Huh? Run away?",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21160,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Escapar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Yeah! Let's hurry up and go look\nfor our friends!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21175,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Vamos rápido a buscar\na nuestros amigos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "I don't want to. I don't mind\nescaping, but I'm not going with\nJoe.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21225,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "No quiero. No me importa\nescapar, pero no pienso ir\ncon Joe."
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21293,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "If we go together, he'll just be a\nnuisance.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21300,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Si vamos juntos, solo será\nun estorbo."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 21345,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "What're you saying? They're all\nour friends!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21349,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¿Qué dices? ¡Todos ellos son\nnuestros amigos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "What do you mean, friends? You're\njust dragging everyone around!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21394,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¿Qué amigos ni qué nada? ¡Solo\nestás arrastrando a todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "I'm tired of this! Go do what you\nlike on your own!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21459,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¡Estoy harto de esto! ¡Haz\nlo que quieras tú solo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "Wh... what?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21511,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Qué... qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "I'm going with T.K! Leave us\nalone!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21523,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Me voy con T.K.! ¡Dejadnos\nen paz!"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "What's wrong with you, Matt?\nWe're all friends, aren't we?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21562,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¿Qué te pasa, Matt?\nSomos todos amigos, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Be quiet! Just come quietly!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21623,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Silencio! ¡Venid tranquilos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "You!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21652,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Tú!"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "You wouldn't be thinking of a way\nto escape from here, would you?",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21657,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "No estaréis pensando en escapar\nde aquí, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "If you were doing that, that'd be\nquite troublesome...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21723,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Si estuvierais haciendo eso,\nsería un buen problema..."
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Huh? That's the Digimon who said\nhe'd lead me to other humans!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21778,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¡Es el Digimon que dijo\nque me llevaría a otros humanos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "He's a bad Digimon who tried to\ntrick us!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21841,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Es un Digimon malo que\nintentó engañarnos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21883,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Why, you! I won't forgive you for\nthat!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21890,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Serás...! ¡No te lo\nperdonaré!"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "You're brave, trying to shirk your\ndebt like that and get away with\nit...",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21930,
      "_bytes": 73,
      "translation": "Qué valiente, intentando\nescaquearte de tu deuda\ny salirte con la tuya..."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "That debt should have been settled\na long time ago!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22004,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¡Esa deuda debería estar saldada\nhace tiempo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Yes, you were very good workers.\nLet me return your change.",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22056,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Sí, sois buenos trabajadores. Os\ndevuelvo el cambio."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "There! Gotcha!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22116,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Ahí! ¡Te tengo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Help meeeeee!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22131,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Socorroooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22145,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22153,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Jajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "If you attack me, I cannot\nguarantee that this child will\nsurvive!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22163,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "¡Si me atacáis, no puedo\ngarantizar que este niño\nsobreviva!"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Matt, help meeeeeee!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22230,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Matt, ¡socorroooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "You coward! I can't forgive\nthis...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22253,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Cobarde! No te perdono\nesto..."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Aaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22289,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "Gh...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22298,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Gh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "J...Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22304,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡J...Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "Why?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22313,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡¿Por qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "Up 'til now, you've been saying\nthat we were in this together.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22319,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Hasta ahora, decías que\nestábamos juntos en esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "You've been putting up with me, so\nit's my turn.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22382,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Me has aguantado, así que\nme toca a mí."
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "I... even after I said all those\nhorrible things. Joe... Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22431,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "Yo... después de decir esas\ncosas horribles. Joe... ¡Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "He's too strong. It's over.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22493,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Es muy fuerte. Se acabó."
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "No, that's not true, we'll figure\nout a way!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22521,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡No, eso no es cierto, algo\nse nos ocurrirá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "I still haven't forgotten my\nfriends. I believe in them, and in\nour friendship!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22566,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Aún no he olvidado a mis\namigos. ¡Creo en ellos, y en\nnuestra amistad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "W-what?!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22646,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡¿Q-qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "That's the power of Matt's\nCrest.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22655,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Es el poder del Emblema\nde Matt."
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "Go, WereGarurumon! Don't hold\nback, not for even a second!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22691,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "¡Ve, WereGarurumon! ¡No te\ncontengas ni un segundo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "Gwaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 4241,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22750,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Gwaaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "english": "Huh? Digitamamon?",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22765,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Digitamamon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "english": "N-no way! Digitamamon!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22783,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡N-no! ¡Digitamamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "english": "Hurry, ruuuuuuuuun!",
      "speaker_id": 4231,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22806,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Rápido, corred!"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "english": "You saved Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22826,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Has salvado a Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "english": "Joe... thank you for saving\nT.K.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22841,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Joe... gracias por salvar\na T.K."
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "english": "It's fine. I was always the one\nyou were getting out of trouble,\nanyway.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22877,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Tranquilo. Siempre eras tú\nquien me sacaba de líos,\nde todos modos."
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "english": "And...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22950,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Y..."
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22957,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¿Eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "english": "I'm sorry.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22962,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "Lo siento."
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22973,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "english": "...so you're saying, if we don't\ndo something about this world,\nit'll affect ours as well.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22983,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "...o sea, que si no hacemos\nalgo con este mundo, también\nafectará al nuestro."
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "english": "Pretty mu... hm?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23074,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "Más o men... ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "english": "What?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23091,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¿Qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "english": "A reaction! Our friends are around\nhere!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23097,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¡Una reacción! ¡Nuestros\namigos están cerca!"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "english": "Mine, too! It's coming from this\nway...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23138,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡La mía igual! Viene por\naquí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "english": "Mine's coming from that way.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23178,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "La mía viene por allí."
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "english": "Well, we'll split up into two\ngroups. I'll go with T.K.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23207,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Bueno, nos dividimos en dos\ngrupos. Yo voy con T.K."
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "english": "Okay, then. Joe, you'll come with\nme.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23266,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Vale, pues. Joe, tú vienes\nconmigo."
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "english": "But...if we can't meet up again,\nwhat are we gonna do?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23304,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Pero... si no podemos vernos,\n¿qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "english": "In that case, we'll meet up at the\nbottom of that mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23359,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "En ese caso, nos vemos al pie\nde esa montaña."
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "english": "Got it. Let's do that.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23419,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Vale. Hagamos eso."
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "english": "Hey...we *are* going to meet\nagain, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23442,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Oye... vamos a\nvolver a vernos, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "english": "We'll meet again. Because we're\nfriends.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23485,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Nos volveremos a ver,\nsomos amigos."
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "english": "Yeah, we'll definitely see each\nother again.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23526,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Sí, seguro que nos veremos\nde nuevo."
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "english": "You're right. We're friends.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23571,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Tienes razón. Somos amigos."
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "english": "I hear voices from inside. It\nsounds pretty busy in there.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23600,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Oigo voces ahí dentro.\nParece que hay mucho jaleo."
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "english": "Let's go check out the restaurant\nfor now.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23659,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Vamos a ver ese restaurante\npor ahora."
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "english": "I could have sworn I heard\nT.K's voice earlier.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23702,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Juraría que antes oí\nla voz de T.K."
    }
  ]
}